{"id":"v1","level":4,"levelName":"The verb system","n":1,"of":10,"title":"What will happen","titleHe":"זְמַן עָתִיד","goal":"Use the future of pa'al, where the person is a prefix rather than an ending.","sections":[{"type":"text","body":"The past hangs its person on the end of the word. The future puts it on the front — א for I, ת for you and she, י for he, נ for we. Once you know those four letters you can read any future verb's person off its first letter."},{"type":"binyan","he":"פָּעַל","en":"pa'al (kal)","note":"The plain, basic verb — the one most everyday actions use.","verb":{"root":"כ־ת־ב","inf":"לִכְתֹּב","en":"to write"},"tense":"future","rows":[{"label":"I","he":"אֲנִי","form":"אֶכְתֹּב"},{"label":"you (m.)","he":"אַתָּה","form":"תִּכְתֹּב"},{"label":"you (f.)","he":"אַתְּ","form":"תִּכְתְּבִי"},{"label":"he","he":"הוּא","form":"יִכְתֹּב"},{"label":"she","he":"הִיא","form":"תִּכְתֹּב"},{"label":"we","he":"אֲנַחְנוּ","form":"נִכְתֹּב"},{"label":"you (m.pl.)","he":"אַתֶּם","form":"תִּכְתְּבוּ"},{"label":"you (f.pl.)","he":"אַתֶּן","form":"תִּכְתְּבוּ"},{"label":"they","he":"הֵם / הֵן","form":"יִכְתְּבוּ"}]},{"type":"tip","body":"ת does double duty: תִּכְתֹּב is both you (m.) will write and she will write. Only context or a pronoun tells them apart."},{"type":"examples","items":[{"he":"מָחָר אֶכְתֹּב מִכְתָּב.","en":"Tomorrow I'll write a letter."},{"he":"מָתַי תָּבוֹא?","en":"When will you come?"},{"he":"נִרְאֶה.","en":"We'll see."}]}],"vocab":[{"he":"מִכְתָּב","en":"letter","translit":"michtav"},{"he":"אוּלַי","en":"maybe","translit":"ulai"},{"he":"בְּוַדַּאי","en":"certainly","translit":"bevadai"},{"he":"אַחַר כָּךְ","en":"afterwards","translit":"achar kach"},{"he":"עוֹד","en":"more, still, another","translit":"od"}],"exercises":[{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["tired","narrative, legend","letter","good"],"correct":2,"prompt":"מִכְתָּב","translit":"michtav"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["even though","maybe","clean","hook"],"correct":1,"prompt":"אוּלַי","translit":"ulai"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["puts","law, ruling","kindness, grace","certainly"],"correct":3,"prompt":"בְּוַדַּאי","translit":"bevadai"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["afterwards","sheep, lamb","bad","come and hear"],"correct":0,"prompt":"אַחַר כָּךְ","translit":"achar kach"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["more, still, another","hard, difficult","snow","small"],"correct":0,"prompt":"עוֹד","translit":"od"},{"type":"choice","q":"How do you say “letter”?","options":["סוֹד","הֲלָכָה","מִכְתָּב","יַעַר"],"correct":2,"he":true},{"type":"choice","q":"write — you (f.), future","options":["אֶכְתֹּב","תִּכְתֹּב","יִכְתֹּב","תִּכְתְּבִי"],"correct":3,"he":true,"why":"פָּעַל, future: you (f.) is תִּכְתְּבִי."},{"type":"choice","q":"write — I, future","options":["תִּכְתְּבִי","תִּכְתֹּב","אֶכְתֹּב","יִכְתֹּב"],"correct":2,"he":true,"why":"פָּעַל, future: I is אֶכְתֹּב."},{"type":"choice","q":"write — they, future","options":["תִּכְתְּבִי","אֶכְתֹּב","יִכְתְּבוּ","תִּכְתֹּב"],"correct":2,"he":true,"why":"פָּעַל, future: they is יִכְתְּבוּ."},{"type":"cloze","sentence":"מָחָר ___ מִכְתָּב.","en":"Tomorrow I'll write a letter.","options":["עוֹד","אֶכְתֹּב","אוּלַי","בְּוַדַּאי"],"correct":1,"full":"מָחָר אֶכְתֹּב מִכְתָּב."},{"type":"match","pairs":[["מִכְתָּב","letter"],["אוּלַי","maybe"],["בְּוַדַּאי","certainly"],["אַחַר כָּךְ","afterwards"],["עוֹד","more, still, another"]]},{"type":"choice","q":"write — you (m.pl.), future","options":["אֶכְתֹּב","תִּכְתְּבוּ","תִּכְתֹּב","תִּכְתְּבִי"],"correct":1,"he":true,"why":"פָּעַל, future: you (m.pl.) is תִּכְתְּבוּ."},{"type":"choice","q":"How do you say “more, still, another”?","options":["מִרְפֶּסֶת","עוֹד","דּוֹמֶה","בֹּקֶר טוֹב"],"correct":1,"he":true},{"type":"choice","q":"How do you say “maybe”?","options":["חֲנֻכָּה","בִּנְיָן","אוּלַי","בְּעוֹד"],"correct":2,"he":true},{"type":"choice","q":"How do you say “afterwards”?","options":["אַחַר כָּךְ","שֵׂעָר","חָתָן","מְנַסֶּה"],"correct":0,"he":true},{"type":"type","q":"Write “maybe” in Hebrew","answer":"אוּלַי","hint":"ulai"}]}